blish the underlying approval duty from this packet.","source_unit_ids":["d97b56331f41a.u5.840"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"The operative measure removes a prior-approval requirement for qualifying changes. It does not approve the change, excuse home-law compliance or remove post-vetting. Post-vetting is stated to continue; follow-up enquiries and regulatory actions are discretionary possibilities.","source_unit_ids":["d97b56331f41a.u5.840","d97b56331f41a.u12.2069"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"The express date is 28 November 2025. The proposal reads 'immediate effect' consistently with that date, although the packet supplies no circular issue date. Pre-effective-date applications remaining unapproved follow the existing process; the precise assessment time for their pending status is unstated.","source_unit_ids":["d97b56331f41a.u1.190","d97b56331f41a.u9.1696","d97b56331f41a.u10.1809"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"Implementation is expressly located in relevant FAQs. Those contents, related forms/checklists, applicable home requirements and the existing approval process are unavailable. Dependency identifiers missing.1c25ffdf5c1e10e0297748d5 and missing.79fb54125bb1f35a1d457fad have no supplied contents or explicit mapping to particular references.","source_unit_ids":["d97b56331f41a.u5.840","d97b56331f41a.u7.1419","d97b56331f41a.u9.1696","d97b56331f41a.u10.1809","d97b56331f41a.u18.2831","d97b56331f41a.u19.2914"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["What conditions or classifications do the revised FAQs impose on this particular investment change?","What existing approval rule governs a change excluded from relief, and does it require prior approval in the specific case?","Does the transition preserve only processing of the pending application, or also prevent withdrawal and use of the new relief for the same change?","When is pending status assessed, and what date governs